# melee defence band matrix -- internal/combat sendDefenseMessages
# Each cell drives the REAL production function with a one-variant-per-band
# fixture, so a row names the BAND selected, not authored prose.
# columns: defence | defender z-score | normalized margin | partial | role => band
# partial=false is the defensive-CRIT call site (combat_helpers.go:1204);
# partial=true is the mitigated defensive win (:1244), which sends the room line only.
# M4c: the band comes from meleeDefenceMargin(best) plus the crit flag, the same
# derivation production uses -- not a copy of it.

